; A program without any Gosub can still use Return in the main program: it ends the program like End, as in the original.
; The subroutine label behind it is never reached.
Include "check.bb"

Local frames = 0
.again
frames = frames + 1
If frames < 3 Then Goto again
Check "Goto loop", frames, 3
Done "language_return_main_no_gosub"
Return
RuntimeError "Return did not end the program."

.unused
Return
